---
import InvestigateLayout from '../../layouts/InvestigateLayout.astro';
---

<InvestigateLayout title="Charge model" strand="Models">
  <article class="inv-card">
    <p class="inv-kicker">Model card · earned in E1</p>
    <h1 class="inv-title">Charge</h1>
    <p class="inv-lead">
      Compact record of what the balloon investigation established — and what it did not.
    </p>

    <h2 class="sec">Established</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>two kinds of charge</li>
      <li>like repels · unlike attracts</li>
      <li>charge can transfer (working inference: rearranged, not created)</li>
      <li>neutral means balanced, not empty</li>
      <li>net ≠ total</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="sec">Representation</h2>
    <div class="math-block">
      Q<sub>net</sub> = Q<sub>+</sub> − Q<sub>−</sub>
      <span class="sub">500 + 500 kinds → net 0, but 1000 units still present</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="sec">Not yet established</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>microscopic carrier</li>
      <li>quantisation</li>
      <li>why particular materials exchange which way</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="sec">Used later by</h2>
    <p class="note-soft">E2 · E3 · E4 · C1 · … (as those investigations are built)</p>

    <div class="inv-actions">
      <a href="/models" class="inv-btn">All models</a>
      <a href="/learn/electricity/what-is-charge" class="inv-btn primary">Replay investigation</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</InvestigateLayout>

<style>
  .sec {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0.45rem;
  }
  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.15rem;
  }
</style>
